OL,3,AKellogg's admits snap, crackle and pop
OL,4,Ais quieter after uproar over Rice
OL,5,AKrispies recipe change
OL,6,
OL,7,FKellogg's has told the BBC the "snap,
OL,8,Fcrackle and pop" sound made by its Rice
OL,9,FKrispies may be noticeably quieter
OL,10,Fafter an uproar over the cereal giant's
OL,11,Frecipe change.
OL,13,FRice Krispies and Coco Pops are no
OL,14,Flonger being made with whole rice
OL,15,Fgrains, with the tiny toasted puffs
OL,16,Fbeing made using corn flour and rice
OL,17,Fflour instead.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,116,105,200,300,0,100
